*.py
# ...except the CI scripts. tools/check-nav.py is what .github/workflows/nav-check.yml runs,
# and the blanket *.py above meant it was never committed: CI checked out, could not find the
# file, and Python exited 2. The workflow was added 2026-08-21 and had never once run.
# A check that cannot run is worse than no check, because it looks like cover.
!tools/*.py
translation-glossary-research.md
maja-spec/

